clueweb09-enwp01-91-07147.0 Sun Java System From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Jump to: navigation, search Sun Java System is a brand used by Sun Microsystems to market computer software. The Sun Java System brand superseded the Sun ONE brand on September 2003. There are two major suites under this brand, the Sun Java Enterprise System suite of infrastructure software, and the Sun Java Desktop System graphical user environment. Contents 1 Sun Java Enterprise System 1.1 Identity management services (Sun Java Identity Management Suite) 1.2 Business Integration - SOA (Sun Java Composite Application Platform Suite) 1.3 Web and application services 1.4 Portal services 1.5 Availability services (Sun Java Availability Suite) 1.6 Development tools 2 Sun Java Desktop System 3 External links [edit] Sun Java Enterprise System The Sun Java Enterprise System is itself broken into smaller suites, which include: [edit] Identity management services (Sun Java Identity Management Suite) Sun Java System Access Manager Sun
